## 3. Typography — Inter

One family, weights 400/500/600/700/800. Enable `cv05`+`ss01` for clean digits. Money/quantities use tabular figures.

| Role | Size / Weight | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Display | 34 / 700 | page hero only |
| Money XL | 30 / 700 | the one dominant number, tabular, `-0.02em` |
| H1 (screen title) | 22 / 700 | |
| H2 (panel title) | 18 / 600 | |
| Money / KPI | 17 / 700 | tabular |
| Title (row/card) | 15 / 600 | |
| Body | 14 / 400 | default (dense) |
| Body S | 13 / 400 | secondary, descriptions |
| Label | 12 / 500–700 | captions; eyebrow = 700 + `0.05em` UPPER |
| Micro | 11 / 400 | timestamps, legal |

