## 5. Desktop layout

```
┌────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Sidebar   │  Top bar (title · search · primary action) │ 64px
│  220px     ├───────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  surface   │  Content · bg · 22–24px padding            │
│  +R border │   • KPI row (4 cards, equal)               │
│            │   • 2-col: chart (1.6fr) + list (1fr)      │
│  nav items │   • full-width table card                  │
│  user @bot │                                            │
└────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────┘
```
- **Breakpoints:** ≥1280 full; 1024–1280 collapse KPI row to 2×2, stack the 2-col; <1024 hand off to mobile doc.
- **Grid:** 12-col, 24px gutter inside content.
- **Sidebar:** fixed 220px, `surface` + right `1px --line`. Brand top, nav groups with `--eyebrow` labels, user card pinned bottom (`surface-2`).

