## 6. Components (desktop specs)

**Button** — h44 (lg 52, sm 36), radius `md`, weight 600.
`primary` lime+ink · `ink` dark+white · `soft` tint+accent-strong · `ghost` surface + `line-2` border · `danger` · `disabled` surface-3+placeholder. Hover: primary→`accent-press`, ghost→`surface-2`.

**Sidebar nav item** — h40, radius `sm`, icon 19 + label 14/500. Active = `accent-tint` bg, `accent-strong` text, `inset 2px 0 accent-press` left rule.

**Search / field** — h44, `surface` + `line-2` border, radius `md`. Focus: `accent-press` border + `0 0 0 3px accent-tint` ring. Placeholder `--placeholder`.

**KPI card** — `surface` + `line` border, radius `lg`, 16×18 pad. Label 12 muted (+ optional 14px icon), value 26/700 tabular, delta 11.5/600 colored (success ▲ / danger ▼).

**Chart card** — `surface`+`line`, radius `lg`. Bars: track `surface-3`, active series `accent`, radius 6px top. X labels 11 muted. Legend chips = `--chip--soft`.

**Table** — header row: 11/600 `0.05em` UPPER muted, no top border. Cells: 13.5px, `1px --line` top border, 11px vertical pad. Numeric columns right-aligned, tabular. Status cell = `--badge`. Row hover `surface-2`. ID columns tabular 600.

**Badge** — radius `xs`, 12/600, 4×7 pad. Variants: success/warning/danger/info (soft bg + colored text), `accent` (lime+ink), `ink`. Dot = 6px `currentColor`.

**Status text** — 13/500 + 7px dot. ok=success, low=warning, no=danger.

**Chip / tab** — chip h36 radius `sm`, `line-2` border; active = lime+ink. Tab group = `surface`+`line` wrapper radius `md`, pad 4; active tab `ink` (or `--lime` variant) radius `sm`.

**Toggle** — 46×26 pill, knob 20px white. On = lime. (Only round control.)

**Order summary row** — label `ink-2` ↔ value tabular `ink` 600; total row = `1px line-2` top border, 18/700.

