## 7. Flutter notes

- Put tokens in a `ThemeExtension<VoltTokens>` (colors, radii, spacing) + a `TextTheme` of Inter styles. Don't hardcode hex in widgets — read from `Theme.of(context).extension<VoltTokens>()`.
- Money: `Text(amount, style: ts.copyWith(fontFeatures: const [FontFeature.tabularFigures()]))`.
- Desktop = `MediaQuery.size.width >= 1024`; below that, route to the mobile component set.
- Tables: `DataTable`/`Table` with a custom header style; right-align numeric `DataColumn(numeric: true)`.
- Hover states matter on desktop — use `MouseRegion`/`InkWell` with the hover colors above.
- Charts: `fl_chart` (or custom) — primary series `accent`, inactive `surface-3`.

```dart
class VoltTokens extends ThemeExtension<VoltTokens> {
  final Color accent, accentInk, accentStrong, accentTint;
  final Color bg, surface, surface2, ink, ink2, muted, line, line2;
  final Color success, warning, danger, info;
  const VoltTokens({/* ...all fields... */});
  static const light = VoltTokens(
    accent: Color(0xFF99FF47), accentInk: Color(0xFF14180E),
    accentStrong: Color(0xFF498F18), accentTint: Color(0xFFEAF7D6),
    bg: Color(0xFFF3F5EE), surface: Color(0xFFFFFFFF), surface2: Color(0xFFECEFE4),
    ink: Color(0xFF14180E), ink2: Color(0xFF4C5142), muted: Color(0xFF7C8270),
    line: Color(0xFFE6E9DD), line2: Color(0xFFD4D8C7),
    success: Color(0xFF498F18), warning: Color(0xFFB0760A),
    danger: Color(0xFFD43A3F), info: Color(0xFF3E6FE0),
  );
  // radii: xs3 sm5 md7 lg9 xl12 ; spacing: 4..40 ; @override copyWith/lerp
}
```

