## 8. Do / Don't

✅ One filled-lime action per screen · borders for separation · tabular money · ink on lime · right-align numbers in tables.
❌ White text on lime · multiple lime buttons competing · drop-shadows everywhere · rounding past 12px · lime for both brand *and* a second "success" green (lime **is** the success green).

